<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Rand Mines unbundling to go ahead.</title>
<headline>Rand Mines unbundling to go ahead.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Rand Mines Ltd said on Thursday that it had fulfilled all the conditions needed to press ahead with its unbundling.</p>
<p>The firm said its listing on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange would be transferred to the cash companies sector and warned shareholders to exercise caution when dealing in its shares until a further announcement is made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
